<!--
  Odoo 19 – Construction Monitoring card in the "Franchise Quick Links" on the portal home (/my).

  The card only shows for portal users whose Contact has a value in the Studio field
  "Construction Key" (technical name x_studio_construction_key), same idea as the Machine Portal card.

  Where to paste:
    Settings → Technical → User Interface → Views → open
    "My Portal (oe_structure_portal_my_home_2)" → Architecture.
    Paste the <a>…</a> card below right AFTER the Machine Portal card's closing </a>.
    The Machine Portal card appears TWICE in that view (inside <template> and inside the
    "s_embed_code_embedded" div) – add the card in BOTH places, then Save.
-->
<a t-if="user_id.partner_id.x_studio_construction_key" t-att-href="'https://suds-construction.pages.dev/?k=%s' % user_id.partner_id.x_studio_construction_key" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="suds-ql-card">
  <div class="suds-ql-icon" style="background:#fff4ec;">🏗️</div>
  <div class="suds-ql-title">Construction Monitoring</div>
  <div class="suds-ql-desc">Quotations, contractors, weekly progress, payments and turnover of your store build.</div>
  <div class="suds-ql-cta">Open Construction Monitoring →</div>
</a>
